@startuml
!theme plain
title Smart Auto — Sequence: sign up & automatic profile (migration triggers)

actor User
participant "Flutter app" as App
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
database "auth.users" as AUsers
database "public.profiles" as Prof

User -> App: Register (email/password)
App -> Auth: signUp()
Auth -> AUsers: INSERT user
activate AUsers
AUsers -> Prof: AFTER INSERT **on_auth_user_created**
activate Prof
Prof -> Prof: **handle_new_user()**\nINSERT profiles(id, name)
Prof --> AUsers
deactivate Prof
deactivate AUsers
Auth --> App: session
App --> User: Logged in

User -> App: Update profile / image
App -> Prof: UPDATE profiles\n(RLS: own row)
Prof --> App: OK

@enduml
